                                                "sense_id": "b7e8e8cc-d73e-3594-86a9-26679d7c59c0",
                                                "text": "The death of cardinal York extinguished the descendants of James II., and as he had no brother but Charles II., who prædeceased him without legitimate issue, the succession the opened to the descendants of his sister, the princess Henrietta Maria, wife of Phillippe, duke of Orleans."
                                            },
